# Static assets are served from the repo root so the mockups stay the source
# with no build step. Everything is excluded, then the two folders the pages
# need are let back in, then the heavy working files inside assets/ are kept
# out (photos, contact sheets, converter experiments).
*
!mockups/
!mockups/**
!assets/
!assets/**
assets/originals/
assets/ega/frames/
assets/ega/hat/sheet*.png
assets/ega/hat/actual-size.png
assets/ega/hat/src/
assets/ega/hat/mutiny-blackspot.png
assets/ega/hat/mutiny-cutlass.png
assets/ega/hat/mutiny-flag.png
assets/ega/hat/mutiny-noose.png
assets/ega/hat/hat-mono-*.png
assets/ega/hat/captain_ega_pixelated.png
assets/ega/ega_reilly/IMG_5278*.png
assets/ega/ega_reilly/ummbazinga.*
assets/ega/ega_reilly/bazinga_*.png
assets/ega/ega_reilly/palette-from-portrait.png
assets/ega/ega_reilly/sheet*.png
assets/ega/ega_reilly/tile-*.png
assets/ega/4498d8524a3afb7b053af2b66ba63207.jpg
assets/ega/ummbazinga.*
assets/ega/lookatmeiamthecaptainnow.png
assets/black-pirate-bandana-md.png
assets/cutout.m
